    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17045",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nIs all our company here?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17045/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17045/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 32,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4243109,
        "end": 4243171,
        "line": 157090,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@17045",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17111",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTTOM.\nYou were best to call them generally, man by man, according to the scrip.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17111/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17111/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 81,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4243175,
        "end": 4243286,
        "line": 157095,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@17111",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BOTTOM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17226",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nHere is the scroll of every man’s name, which is thought fit through all Athens, to play in our interlude before the Duke and Duchess, on his wedding-day at night.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17226/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17226/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 171,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4243290,
        "end": 4243493,
        "line": 157100,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@17226",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17433",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTTOM.\nFirst, good Peter Quince, say what the play treats on; then read the names of the actors; and so grow to a point.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17433/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17433/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 121,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4243497,
        "end": 4243649,
        "line": 157107,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@17433",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BOTTOM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17589",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nMarry, our play is The most lamentable comedy and most cruel death of Pyramus and Thisbe.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 27,
          "end": 96
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17589/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17589/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 97,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4243653,
        "end": 4243788,
        "line": 157113,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@17589",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17728",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTTOM.\nA very good piece of work, I assure you, and a merry. Now, good Peter Quince, call forth your actors by the scroll. Masters, spread yourselves.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17728/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17728/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 151,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4243792,
        "end": 4243974,
        "line": 157119,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@17728",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BOTTOM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17914",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nAnswer, as I call you. Nick Bottom, the weaver.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17914/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@17914/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 55,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4243978,
        "end": 4244063,
        "line": 157125,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@17914",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18003",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTTOM.\nReady. Name what part I am for, and proceed.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18003/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18003/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4244067,
        "end": 4244149,
        "line": 157130,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@18003",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BOTTOM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18089",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nYou, Nick Bottom, are set down for Pyramus.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18089/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18089/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4244153,
        "end": 4244234,
        "line": 157135,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@18089",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18174",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTTOM.\nWhat is Pyramus—a lover, or a tyrant?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18174/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18174/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 45,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4244238,
        "end": 4244313,
        "line": 157140,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@18174",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BOTTOM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18253",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nA lover, that kills himself most gallantly for love.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18253/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18253/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 60,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4244317,
        "end": 4244407,
        "line": 157145,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@18253",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18347",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTTOM.\nThat will ask some tears in the true performing of it. If I do it, let the audience look to their eyes. I will move storms; I will condole in some measure. To the rest—yet my chief humour is for a tyrant. I could play Ercles rarely, or a part to tear a cat in, to make all split.\n\n    The raging rocks\n    And shivering shocks\n    Shall break the locks\n           Of prison gates,\n    And Phibbus’ car\n    Shall shine from far,\n    And make and mar\n           The foolish Fates.\n\nThis was lofty. Now name the rest of the players. This is Ercles’ vein, a tyrant’s vein; a lover is more condoling.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18347/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@18347/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 287,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
