      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20254",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SNOUT\nHere, Peter Quince.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20254/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20254/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4246318,
        "end": 4246373,
        "line": 157238,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@20254",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SNOUT",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20313",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nYou, Pyramus’ father; myself, Thisbe’s father;\nSnug, the joiner, you, the lion’s part. And, I hope here is a play fitted.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20313/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20313/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20313/line-3",
          "start": 55,
          "end": 129,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4246377,
        "end": 4246542,
        "line": 157243,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@20313",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20482",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SNUG\nHave you the lion’s part written? Pray you, if it be, give it me, for I am slow of study.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20482/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 4,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20482/line-2",
          "start": 5,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4246546,
        "end": 4246671,
        "line": 157250,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@20482",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SNUG",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20611",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nYou may do it extempore, for it is nothing but roaring.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20611/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20611/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 63,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4246675,
        "end": 4246768,
        "line": 157256,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@20611",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20708",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTTOM.\nLet me play the lion too. I will roar that I will do any man’s heart good to hear me. I will roar that I will make the Duke say ‘Let him roar again, let him roar again.’",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20708/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20708/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 177,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4246772,
        "end": 4246981,
        "line": 157261,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@20708",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BOTTOM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20921",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nIf you should do it too terribly, you would fright the Duchess and the ladies, that they would shriek; and that were enough to hang us all.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20921/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@20921/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 147,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4246985,
        "end": 4247163,
        "line": 157268,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@20921",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21103",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ALL\nThat would hang us every mother’s son.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21103/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21103/line-2",
          "start": 4,
          "end": 42,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4247167,
        "end": 4247239,
        "line": 157274,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@21103",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ALL",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21179",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTTOM.\nI grant you, friends, if you should fright the ladies out of their wits, they would have no more discretion but to hang us. But I will aggravate my voice so, that I will roar you as gently as any sucking dove; I will roar you an ’twere any nightingale.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21179/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21179/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 260,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4247243,
        "end": 4247536,
        "line": 157279,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@21179",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BOTTOM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21476",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nYou can play no part but Pyramus, for Pyramus is a sweet-faced man; a proper man as one shall see in a summer’s day; a most lovely gentleman-like man. Therefore you must needs play Pyramus.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21476/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21476/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 197,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4247540,
        "end": 4247769,
        "line": 157287,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@21476",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "QUINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21709",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTTOM.\nWell, I will undertake it. What beard were I best to play it in?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21709/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21709/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 72,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4247773,
        "end": 4247875,
        "line": 157294,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap24/p@21709",
        "anchor": "sceneI_24.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BOTTOM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21815",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "QUINCE.\nWhy, what you will.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "a-midsummer-nights-dream/sceneI_24.2/p@21815/line-1",
